    "detailed_description": "&quot;<i>First Step</i>&quot; is a short demo for the upcoming &quot;Dropkick Navvy&quot;, designed to help us fine-tune the fun.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/f721e331c00c51607acca871a1e80fe3.avif?t=1729020123\" /></span><br><br>Do you dig crafting games like <i>Minecraft</i>, <i>Astroneer</i>, and <i>Forager</i>? How about goofy physics sims like <i>Human: Fall Flat</i> or <i>Moving Out</i>?<br><br>We love both \u2014 so we smushed em together!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/95d41a6307baaf2f801af0d3cd476101.poster.avif?t=1729020123\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/95d41a6307baaf2f801af0d3cd476101.webm?t=1729020123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/95d41a6307baaf2f801af0d3cd476101.mp4?t=1729020123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/787503acdd420dc19fffac2d5c29e1bc.avif?t=1729020123\" /></span><br><br>Go ham on rocks and trees with slapdash tools you made yourself, then pile \u2018em into your little wicker basket and wobble back to your workbench in charmingly precarious fashion. <br><br>Or just dropkick them suckers clear across the map. Ain't nobody got time for all that.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/589a1445198eed8cc533b7f459310b48.poster.avif?t=1729020123\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/589a1445198eed8cc533b7f459310b48.webm?t=1729020123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/589a1445198eed8cc533b7f459310b48.mp4?t=1729020123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Roam the cosmos and knock down everything in your path to turn them into stuff! <br></li><li>Can\u2019t hold all the stuff? Try throwing it or using a basket or something! </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/7c4c012b172d3e2f1ccd5a18dbe6c6e4.poster.avif?t=1729020123\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/7c4c012b172d3e2f1ccd5a18dbe6c6e4.webm?t=1729020123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/7c4c012b172d3e2f1ccd5a18dbe6c6e4.mp4?t=1729020123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Craft some tools! And then craft some more tools! And keep crafting until you run out! <br></li><li>Then use those tools to help you gather more stuff to craft even more tools. Oh, and workbenches too! </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/6a2b6ea2333c6330b097860f0e49061f.poster.avif?t=1729020123\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/6a2b6ea2333c6330b097860f0e49061f.webm?t=1729020123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/6a2b6ea2333c6330b097860f0e49061f.mp4?t=1729020123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Don\u2019t forget the Growth Potions. Craft some of those and throw them at the World Tree! <br></li><li>Watch the World Tree grow taller! So tall that you might need a little boost to reach its branches! </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/9459e634261553aeea3c1b391a70ff04.poster.avif?t=1729020123\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/9459e634261553aeea3c1b391a70ff04.webm?t=1729020123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/9459e634261553aeea3c1b391a70ff04.mp4?t=1729020123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Expand, expand, expand, until you can\u2019t expand anymore! <br></li><li>New lands, new materials, new puzzles just waiting to be revealed! </li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "&quot;<i>First Step</i>&quot; is a short demo for the upcoming &quot;Dropkick Navvy&quot;, designed to help us fine-tune the fun.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/f721e331c00c51607acca871a1e80fe3.avif?t=1729020123\" /></span><br><br>Do you dig crafting games like <i>Minecraft</i>, <i>Astroneer</i>, and <i>Forager</i>? How about goofy physics sims like <i>Human: Fall Flat</i> or <i>Moving Out</i>?<br><br>We love both \u2014 so we smushed em together!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/95d41a6307baaf2f801af0d3cd476101.poster.avif?t=1729020123\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/95d41a6307baaf2f801af0d3cd476101.webm?t=1729020123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/95d41a6307baaf2f801af0d3cd476101.mp4?t=1729020123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/787503acdd420dc19fffac2d5c29e1bc.avif?t=1729020123\" /></span><br><br>Go ham on rocks and trees with slapdash tools you made yourself, then pile \u2018em into your little wicker basket and wobble back to your workbench in charmingly precarious fashion. <br><br>Or just dropkick them suckers clear across the map. Ain't nobody got time for all that.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/589a1445198eed8cc533b7f459310b48.poster.avif?t=1729020123\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s