th Potions. Craft some of those and throw them at the World Tree! <br></li><li>Watch the World Tree grow taller! So tall that you might need a little boost to reach its branches! </li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/9459e634261553aeea3c1b391a70ff04.poster.avif?t=1729020123\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/9459e634261553aeea3c1b391a70ff04.webm?t=1729020123\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2530500/extras/9459e634261553aeea3c1b391a70ff04.mp4?t=1729020123\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Expand, expand, expand, until you can\u2019t expand anymore! <br></li><li>New lands, new materials, new puzzles just waiting to be revealed! </li></ul>",
